
**** 04/27/26 22:53:45 ***** PSpice 25.1.0 (25 March 2026) **** ID# 0 ********

 * Native BJT reference temperature-sweep task.


 ****     CIRCUIT DESCRIPTION


******************************************************************************



* Run the native PSpice DC temperature sweep, keep the generated
* .out/.dat/.measure artifacts, and export the six VREF points.

VCC   VCC 0  DC 5
RBIAS VCC N1 15k
Q1    N1  N1 N2 QREF
Q2    N2  N2 0  QREF
.MODEL QREF NPN (IS=1E-15 BF=150 VAF=100 IKF=0.2 CJE=8P CJC=3P TF=0.5N)

.DC VCC 5 5 1
.TEMP -40 -20 0 25 50 85
.MEAS DC VREF FIND V(N1) AT=5
.PROBE

.END

